{"id":"nave:laban","source":"nave","name":"Laban","slug":"laban","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Son of Bethuel Ge 28:5","refs":[["Gen",28,5,28,5]]},{"text":"Brother of Rebekah Ge 22:23; 24:15,29","refs":[["Gen",22,23,22,23],["Gen",24,15,24,15],["Gen",24,29,24,29]]},{"text":"Receives the servant of Abraham Ge 24:29-33","refs":[["Gen",24,29,24,33]]},{"text":"Receives Jacob, and gives him his daughters in marriage Ge 29:12-30","refs":[["Gen",29,12,29,30]]},{"text":"Jacob becomes his servant Ge 29:15-20,27; 30:27-43","refs":[["Gen",29,15,29,20],["Gen",29,27,29,27],["Gen",30,27,30,43]]},{"text":"Outwitted by Jacob Ge 30:37-43; 31:1-21","refs":[["Gen",30,37,30,43],["Gen",31,1,31,21]]},{"text":"Pursues Jacob, overtakes him at Mount Gilead, and covenants with him Ge 31:22-55","refs":[["Gen",31,22,31,55]]}],"refCount":12}
